// Day 3 Task 9 (02 §3): the agent courtesies the comment above used to defer
// -- /llms.txt (the curated index) and the MCP endpoint. /llms-full.txt is
// deliberately NOT linked here: it is the bulk-ingestion corpus and
// /llms.txt already points at it (task-9-brief.md Step 3), so a footer link
// to both would be redundant, and a footer link to the raw corpus is not a
// courtesy to a human visitor scanning the colophon. The `.md` variant
// routes (Task 7) have no single URL to link -- they are discoverable
// page-by-page via each HTML page's own <link rel="alternate">.
//
// Fix round 1 (task-9-report.md): the MCP link is `/mcp` on that domain, not
// the bare origin -- the custom domain is only the host,
// `workers/mcp/src/index.ts`'s `createMcpHandler(..., { route: '/mcp' })`
// mounts the actual JSON-RPC endpoint at that path, and the bare origin
// 404s. Verified live: POST https://mcp.ryanlindsey.me/mcp with an
// `initialize` body succeeds.
